                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="519 2840 519 2855 1663 2859 1665 2859 1667 2859 1695 2849 1756 2859 1758 2859 1855 2846 2027 2857 2029 2857 2031 2857 2059 2846 2152 2857 2154 2857 2156 2857 2180 2844 2180 2829 2176 2801 2089 2788 2087 2788 2085 2788 2044 2799 2027 2788 2024 2788 2022 2788 2020 2788 2018 2788 2016 2788 2001 2801 1907 2801 1884 2788 1881 2788 1879 2788 1814 2801 1596 2790 1593 2790 1511 2803 1368 2792 1366 2792 1316 2803 1288 2792 1286 2792 1284 2792 1206 2803 1188 2792 1186 2792 1184 2792 1182 2792 1180 2792 1178 2792 1158 2805 1143 2795 1141 2795 1139 2795 1136 2795 1134 2795 1113 2805 1050 2795 1048 2795 989 2805 929 2795 926 2795 924 2795 879 2805 853 2795 851 2795 848 2795 846 2795 799 2808 770 2797 768 2797 766 2797 599 2808 539 2797 537 2797 534 2797 532 2797 517 2805 519 2840"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="On the Pacific side, Chukchee herdsmen rapidly spread beyond their"/>
                    </TextLine>

